            name: "attach-role-policy",
            description: Some("Attaches the specified managed policy to the specified IAM role. When you attach a managed policy to a role, the managed policy becomes part of the role's permission (access) policy.  You cannot use a managed policy as the role's trust policy. The role's trust policy is created at the same time as the role, using  CreateRole . You can update a role's trust policy using  UpdateAssumerolePolicy .  Use this operation to attach a managed policy to a role. To embed an inline policy in a role, use  PutRolePolicy . For more information about policies, see Managed policies and inline policies in the IAM User Guide. As a best practice, you can validate your IAM policies. To learn more, see Validating IAM policies in the IAM User Guide"),
